'' A line comment starts with two apostrophes and runs to the end
'' of the line. It is the form used for almost every comment.

/' A block comment starts with slash-apostrophe and ends with
   apostrophe-slash. It can span lines, /' and nest '/ inside. '/

dim as int32 x = 5 + /' 90 + '/ 5   '' a block comment mid-expression

print "x is"; x
